{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"可逆线性范畴层"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"可逆线性范畴层"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>可逆线性范畴层是"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":"上"},{"Local":{"url":"可逆层","text":"可逆层"}},{"Plain":" (秩为 $1$ 的局部自由 $\\mathcal{O}_X$-模) 的"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴化","text":"范畴化"}},{"Plain":", 是特殊的"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶拟凝聚层","text":"高阶拟凝聚层"}},{"Plain":", 由 "},{"Local":{"url":"Gestalt","text":"Gestalt"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}^n\\mathbb G_m$ "},{"Local":{"url":"分类空间","text":"分类"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>概形 $X$ 上的<strong>可逆线性 $n$-范畴层</strong>是"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶拟凝聚层","text":"高阶拟凝聚层"}},{"Plain":"的范畴 $(n+1)\\mathsf{QCoh}(X)$ 的可逆对象, 也即由 $\\mathbb G_m$-控制的 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"束","text":"束"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}